# Code ownership for harnery.
# Every path is owned by the maintainer, so every PR auto-requests their review.
# Once branch protection is enabled, this makes maintainer review required.
* @ryanjkelly

# The release PR that changesets/action opens touches only these paths. Leaving
# them unowned keeps that bot PR from requesting the maintainer's review, which
# sent two notification emails per release. A PR that also touches any other
# path still requests review through the rule above.
/.changeset/
/CHANGELOG.md
/package.json
